      },
      {
        "emoji": "🧊",
        "title": "Cold Snap",
        "team": "Turbulent Ticklesh!ts",
        "detail": "The league’s #2 scoring profile crashed to 68.08, the lowest Week 7 total."
      },
      {
        "emoji": "🪙",
        "title": "Schedule Fortune",
        "team": "California Un-Named Team",
        "detail": "6-1 despite ranking #8 in PF and #8 in all-play performance."
      }
    ],
    "tidbits": [
      "California Un-Named Team owns the largest positive gap between actual wins and all-play expected wins: 6 actual versus 3.18 expected.",
      "Flint Tropics owns the largest negative gap: 1 actual win versus 3.27 all-play expected wins.",
      "Sullco MethMouths is the only team ranked #1 in both PF and all-play, and now sits 5-2 after surviving Your Mom by 2.98.",
      "Off Boys is 3-4 despite ranking #3 in PF and #3 in all-play; the schedule has converted a top-three profile into a losing record.",
      "Redwood Murder has the steadiest scoring profile among the contenders, with a 10.80-point standard deviation across seven weeks.",
      "Your Mom leads the league over the last three weeks at 115.27 points per game, even after the narrow Week 7 loss.",
      "Space Cadets earned its second victory with 118.82, its second-best score of the season.",
      "Week 7 produced a 2.98-point East showdown, but the other five games were decided by at least 22.42 points.",
      "The gap between Week 7’s highest and lowest team score was 68.24 points, almost exactly half of Eskimo Brothers’ winning total."
    ],
